    "description": "Positive offset moves the last elements to the front. Negative offset rotates left. Complete cycles preserve values and order.\n\nPositive offset moves the last elements to the front. Negative offset rotates left. Complete cycles preserve values and order.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.array.owned@1.\nExpected:\nresult (array<i64>) = [2,3,4,1]\n",
